List bundled icons and the importable icons and shapes in directories

Usage: kashika icons [OPTIONS] [DIRS]...

Arguments:
  [DIRS]...  Directories to scan (default: the KASHIKA_ICON_PATH entries)

Options:
      --search <SEARCH>  Only list entries whose name, path or keyword contains this term; exits 1 when nothing matches
      --format <FORMAT>  [default: text] [possible values: text, json]
  -h, --help             Print help
